WEBVTT

00:11:31.542 --> 00:11:32.698
So in his kitchen --

00:11:32.722 --> 00:11:35.680
he was in there with his wife, Judy,
and his bodyguard, Sean --

00:11:35.704 --> 00:11:37.760
and I said, "You know
how I said in my email

00:11:37.784 --> 00:11:41.420
that you might have a special brain
anomaly that makes you special?"

00:11:41.444 --> 00:11:44.346
He said, "Yeah, it's an amazing
theory, it's like Star Trek.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.582
You're going where
no man has gone before."

00:11:46.606 --> 00:11:49.710
And I said, "Well --" (Clears throat)

00:11:49.734 --> 00:11:51.063
(Laughter)

00:11:51.087 --> 00:11:54.250
Some psychologists might say

00:11:54.274 --> 00:11:56.952
that this makes you --"
(Mumbles)

00:11:56.976 --> 00:11:58.603
(Laughter)

00:11:58.627 --> 00:12:00.101
And he said, "What?"